  src/clustering/ClusteringService.ts
  src/clustering/EmbeddingProvider.ts
  src/clustering/DataCleaner.ts

Local modifications are summarized in each file's header. In brief: ESM import
extensions, bounds-checked index access, a fix for in-place sorting that broke
the texts/indices correspondence, and an added `indices` return from
DataCleaner.clean() so cluster members can be traced back to the input records.

